[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.24,
    "text": "其實無上班也有很多撞錢錄子",
    "segment_id": "S0001"
  },
  {
    "start": 2.24,
    "end": 4.5600000000000005,
    "text": "而且點現在可以不投錢也不創業",
    "segment_id": "S0002"
  },
  {
    "start": 4.5600000000000005,
    "end": 7.04,
    "text": "我從17歲臭血後9年來就沒上過班",
    "segment_id": "S0003"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.04,
    "end": 9.88,
    "text": "就算習近平有半年主業倒閉的時候也還是有先撞",
    "segment_id": "S0004"
  },
  {
    "start": 9.88,
    "end": 12.88,
    "text": "這個視頻聽完你就會發現是沒處處是上計",
    "segment_id": "S0005"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.88,
    "end": 13.92,
    "text": "先講一個最簡單的",
    "segment_id": "S0006"
  },
  {
    "start": 13.92,
    "end": 15.88,
    "text": "人真都能撞點小錢的例子",
    "segment_id": "S0007"
  },
  {
    "start": 15.88,
    "end": 17.52,
    "text": "我一個朋友以前去這門旅遊",
    "segment_id": "S0008"
  },
  {
    "start": 17.52,
    "end": 20.12,
    "text": "就有經常幫別人帶購惡製員跟朝晚產品",
    "segment_id": "S0009"
  },
  {
    "start": 20.12,
    "end": 21.48,
    "text": "一次就能撞一輛網",
    "segment_id": "S0010"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.48,
    "end": 22.48,
    "text": "雖然不算多",
    "segment_id": "S0011"
  },
  {
    "start": 22.48,
    "end": 23.88,
    "text": "但畢竟不用壓貨",
    "segment_id": "S0012"
  },
  {
    "start": 23.88,
    "end": 25.88,
    "text": "這叫撞地獄交易成本的錢",
    "segment_id": "S0013"
  },
  {
    "start": 25.88,
    "end": 28.52,
    "text": "你應該想想你是沒有什麼產品是別人需要的",
    "segment_id": "S0014"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.52,
    "end": 30.32,
    "text": "比如家鄉用什麼美食",
    "segment_id": "S0015"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.32,
    "end": 32.16,
    "text": "特色產品 特色品牌店",
    "segment_id": "S0016"
  },
  {
    "start": 32.16,
    "end": 34.28,
    "text": "或者你每次到外地國外的時候",
    "segment_id": "S0017"
  },
  {
    "start": 34.28,
    "end": 36.08,
    "text": "想想那裡有什麼特色產品",
    "segment_id": "S0018"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.08,
    "end": 38.2,
    "text": "然後拍攝影片在朋友宣網上一發",
    "segment_id": "S0019"
  },
  {
    "start": 38.2,
    "end": 39.04,
    "text": "客戶就來了",
    "segment_id": "S0020"
  },
  {
    "start": 39.04,
    "end": 40.56,
    "text": "再講一個自己的例子",
    "segment_id": "S0021"
  },
  {
    "start": 40.56,
    "end": 42.32,
    "text": "我創業多年有個很好的希望",
    "segment_id": "S0022"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.32,
    "end": 44.84,
    "text": "我會時刻光住那些龐大的需求",
    "segment_id": "S0023"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.84,
    "end": 47.96,
    "text": "比如我之前發現我們這邊有一家視頻直播公司",
    "segment_id": "S0024"
  },
  {
    "start": 47.96,
    "end": 49.84,
    "text": "我聽說他一天能買1萬頭彈",
    "segment_id": "S0025"
  },
  {
    "start": 49.84,
    "end": 52.8,
    "text": "我馬上就會想那我能給這麼大的需求提供什麼東西",
    "segment_id": "S0026"
  },
  {
    "start": 52.8,
    "end": 54.32,
    "text": "我就特別想給他工貨",
    "segment_id": "S0027"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.32,
    "end": 57.480000000000004,
    "text": "那後面我發現我提供不了有優勢的視頻給他",
    "segment_id": "S0028"
  },
  {
    "start": 57.52,
    "end": 59.160000000000004,
    "text": "但我們做事不能輕易放棄",
    "segment_id": "S0029"
  },
  {
    "start": 59.160000000000004,
    "end": 60.160000000000004,
    "text": "我就繼續想",
    "segment_id": "S0030"
  },
  {
    "start": 60.160000000000004,
    "end": 61.52,
    "text": "後面我真想到個點子",
    "segment_id": "S0031"
  },
  {
    "start": 61.52,
    "end": 63.36000000000001,
    "text": "我可以提供給他快例直下",
    "segment_id": "S0032"
  },
  {
    "start": 63.36000000000001,
    "end": 64.32000000000001,
    "text": "一天以往多彈",
    "segment_id": "S0033"
  },
  {
    "start": 64.32000000000001,
    "end": 65.96000000000001,
    "text": "代表要以往多個直線",
    "segment_id": "S0034"
  },
  {
    "start": 65.96000000000001,
    "end": 68.4,
    "text": "我只要每一個裝一臉點查價就夠了",
    "segment_id": "S0035"
  },
  {
    "start": 68.4,
    "end": 70.36,
    "text": "然後本身自己也沒做過直下",
    "segment_id": "S0036"
  },
  {
    "start": 70.36,
    "end": 72.72,
    "text": "甚至不認識任何一個作者鄉的人",
    "segment_id": "S0037"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.72,
    "end": 74.36,
    "text": "我也是從身邊開始打聽",
    "segment_id": "S0038"
  },
  {
    "start": 74.36,
    "end": 76.56,
    "text": "像上世級在地圖和網上找那些產家",
    "segment_id": "S0039"
  },
  {
    "start": 76.56,
    "end": 77.80000000000001,
    "text": "慢慢看水調合作",
    "segment_id": "S0040"
  },
  {
    "start": 77.80000000000001,
    "end": 79.64,
    "text": "為什麼要跟你們說這個細節呢",
    "segment_id": "S0041"
  },
  {
    "start": 79.64,
    "end": 81.16,
    "text": "就是希望大家知道很多事情",
    "segment_id": "S0042"
  },
  {
    "start": 81.16,
    "end": 84.12,
    "text": "不是等你機器所有地位條件才開始做",
    "segment_id": "S0043"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.12,
    "end": 85.76,
    "text": "恰恰想法是有了冬",
    "segment_id": "S0044"
  },
  {
    "start": 85.76,
    "end": 86.96000000000001,
    "text": "才開始找戲",
    "segment_id": "S0045"
  },
  {
    "start": 86.96000000000001,
    "end": 88.56,
    "text": "再把他們拚起來",
    "segment_id": "S0046"
  },
  {
    "start": 88.56,
    "end": 89.72000000000001,
    "text": "然後你也應該時刻",
    "segment_id": "S0047"
  },
  {
    "start": 89.72000000000001,
    "end": 91.24000000000001,
    "text": "關注那些暴火的店鋪",
    "segment_id": "S0048"
  },
  {
    "start": 91.24000000000001,
    "end": 92.00000000000001,
    "text": "行業",
    "segment_id": "S0049"
  },
  {
    "start": 92.00000000000001,
    "end": 94.2,
    "text": "或是我們會有龐大需求的群體",
    "segment_id": "S0050"
  },
  {
    "start": 94.2,
    "end": 95.48,
    "text": "用心用力去想",
    "segment_id": "S0051"
  },
  {
    "start": 95.48,
    "end": 97.48,
    "text": "怎麼給他們提供產品購服務",
    "segment_id": "S0052"
  },
  {
    "start": 97.48,
    "end": 99.24000000000001,
    "text": "比如你樓下有家奶茶店火",
    "segment_id": "S0053"
  },
  {
    "start": 99.24000000000001,
    "end": 100.92000000000002,
    "text": "你給我從他的所有茶葉",
    "segment_id": "S0054"
  },
  {
    "start": 100.92000000000002,
    "end": 101.56,
    "text": "奶治品",
    "segment_id": "S0055"
  },
  {
    "start": 101.56,
    "end": 102.92000000000002,
    "text": "禮料 杯子包裝帶",
    "segment_id": "S0056"
  },
  {
    "start": 102.92000000000002,
    "end": 105.0,
    "text": "世貝甚至新品配方店鋪推廣",
    "segment_id": "S0057"
  },
  {
    "start": 105.0,
    "end": 106.32000000000001,
    "text": "線上運營等等",
    "segment_id": "S0058"
  },
  {
    "start": 106.32000000000001,
    "end": 107.72000000000001,
    "text": "都給我想一遍",
    "segment_id": "S0059"
  },
  {
    "start": 107.72000000000001,
    "end": 109.36000000000001,
    "text": "找確實能力他的東西",
    "segment_id": "S0060"
  },
  {
    "start": 109.36000000000001,
    "end": 109.92000000000002,
    "text": "賣給他",
    "segment_id": "S0061"
  },
  {
    "start": 109.92000000000002,
    "end": 112.12,
    "text": "現在講第三種輕鬆放弦的思維",
    "segment_id": "S0062"
  },
  {
    "start": 112.12,
    "end": 114.20000000000002,
    "text": "腳位銷售渠道選品",
    "segment_id": "S0063"
  },
  {
    "start": 114.20000000000002,
    "end": 116.92000000000002,
    "text": "這個時代你不需要自己有客戶會銷售",
    "segment_id": "S0064"
  },
  {
    "start": 116.96000000000001,
    "end": 118.92,
    "text": "很多時候你只要找到賣的好的",
    "segment_id": "S0065"
  },
  {
    "start": 118.92,
    "end": 119.64,
    "text": "銷售渠道",
    "segment_id": "S0066"
  },
  {
    "start": 119.64,
    "end": 121.48,
    "text": "給他提供產品中可以",
    "segment_id": "S0067"
  },
  {
    "start": 121.48,
    "end": 122.48,
    "text": "你如果一年的時候",
    "segment_id": "S0068"
  },
  {
    "start": 122.48,
    "end": 124.16,
    "text": "我就發現粉絲直播橫火",
    "segment_id": "S0069"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.16,
    "end": 125.16,
    "text": "我殺選了兩家賣的",
    "segment_id": "S0070"
  },
  {
    "start": 125.16,
    "end": 127.0,
    "text": "最好的直播公司給他們工作",
    "segment_id": "S0071"
  },
  {
    "start": 127.0,
    "end": 128.32,
    "text": "研究清楚他們的客戶",
    "segment_id": "S0072"
  },
  {
    "start": 128.32,
    "end": 129.4,
    "text": "喜歡什麼粉絲",
    "segment_id": "S0073"
  },
  {
    "start": 129.4,
    "end": 130.88,
    "text": "我再去市場上選品",
    "segment_id": "S0074"
  },
  {
    "start": 130.88,
    "end": 132.72,
    "text": "拿過去一場直播就能蠻解釋",
    "segment_id": "S0075"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.72,
    "end": 134.56,
    "text": "這種情況是很輕鬆的",
    "segment_id": "S0076"
  },
  {
    "start": 134.56,
    "end": 136.48,
    "text": "你要是自己去創業開公司",
    "segment_id": "S0077"
  },
  {
    "start": 136.48,
    "end": 137.76,
    "text": "那迫說是會很多",
    "segment_id": "S0078"
  },
  {
    "start": 137.76,
    "end": 138.76,
    "text": "這個時候很多人會說",
    "segment_id": "S0079"
  },
  {
    "start": 138.76,
    "end": 139.76,
    "text": "道理我都懂",
    "segment_id": "S0080"
  },
  {
    "start": 139.76,
    "end": 140.8,
    "text": "但我沒錢買槍品",
    "segment_id": "S0081"
  },
  {
    "start": 140.8,
    "end": 142.28,
    "text": "沒錢壓旁怎麼辦",
    "segment_id": "S0082"
  },
  {
    "start": 142.28,
    "end": 143.08,
    "text": "我要告訴你的時候",
    "segment_id": "S0083"
  },
  {
    "start": 143.08,
    "end": 144.68,
    "text": "但是我調動了善千萬的粉絲",
    "segment_id": "S0084"
  },
  {
    "start": 144.68,
    "end": 145.72,
    "text": "沒有花藝跟錢",
    "segment_id": "S0085"
  },
  {
    "start": 145.72,
    "end": 146.96,
    "text": "我告訴你一個核心",
    "segment_id": "S0086"
  },
  {
    "start": 146.96,
    "end": 148.24,
    "text": "你如果想在任何一個",
    "segment_id": "S0087"
  },
  {
    "start": 148.24,
    "end": 150.08,
    "text": "陌生領域內拿到資源",
    "segment_id": "S0088"
  },
  {
    "start": 150.08,
    "end": 150.88,
    "text": "你都可以想著",
    "segment_id": "S0089"
  },
  {
    "start": 150.88,
    "end": 152.52,
    "text": "先從一個點去突破",
    "segment_id": "S0090"
  },
  {
    "start": 152.52,
    "end": 153.56,
    "text": "假如你和某位老闆",
    "segment_id": "S0091"
  },
  {
    "start": 153.56,
    "end": 155.04,
    "text": "某位公司建立合作",
    "segment_id": "S0092"
  },
  {
    "start": 155.04,
    "end": 157.28,
    "text": "你在這個行業最有的貪資",
    "segment_id": "S0093"
  },
  {
    "start": 157.28,
    "end": 159.16,
    "text": "你會覺得是可以跟你合作",
    "segment_id": "S0094"
  },
  {
    "start": 159.16,
    "end": 159.8,
    "text": "慢慢的",
    "segment_id": "S0095"
  },
  {
    "start": 159.8,
    "end": 161.2,
    "text": "你的資源就擴大",
    "segment_id": "S0096"
  },
  {
    "start": 161.2,
    "end": 162.36,
    "text": "班藍是需要你一定的",
    "segment_id": "S0097"
  },
  {
    "start": 162.36,
    "end": 164.04,
    "text": "市交能力跟實力背書",
    "segment_id": "S0098"
  },
  {
    "start": 164.04,
    "end": 166.04,
    "text": "如果你暫時還沒辦法做到的話",
    "segment_id": "S0099"
  },
  {
    "start": 166.04,
    "end": 167.2,
    "text": "就先找那些成本",
    "segment_id": "S0100"
  },
  {
    "start": 167.2,
    "end": 168.0,
    "text": "便宜的貨品",
    "segment_id": "S0101"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.0,
    "end": 169.04,
    "text": "支持一件帶發的",
    "segment_id": "S0102"
  },
  {
    "start": 169.04,
    "end": 171.32,
    "text": "或者直接跟廠家長長氣做做",
    "segment_id": "S0103"
  },
  {
    "start": 171.32,
    "end": 172.72,
    "text": "在這個廠門過剩的時候",
    "segment_id": "S0104"
  },
  {
    "start": 172.72,
    "end": 174.68,
    "text": "用心去做肯定可以的",
    "segment_id": "S0105"
  },
  {
    "start": 174.72,
    "end": 175.88,
    "text": "第四種思維",
    "segment_id": "S0106"
  },
  {
    "start": 175.88,
    "end": 177.04000000000002,
    "text": "是你們都聽爛的",
    "segment_id": "S0107"
  },
  {
    "start": 177.04000000000002,
    "end": 178.56,
    "text": "叫做信息差兵線",
    "segment_id": "S0108"
  },
  {
    "start": 178.56,
    "end": 179.36,
    "text": "半年要記住",
    "segment_id": "S0109"
  },
  {
    "start": 179.36,
    "end": 180.20000000000002,
    "text": "任何你知道",
    "segment_id": "S0110"
  },
  {
    "start": 180.20000000000002,
    "end": 181.04000000000002,
    "text": "是別人不知道",
    "segment_id": "S0111"
  },
  {
    "start": 181.04000000000002,
    "end": 182.0,
    "text": "誰需要的",
    "segment_id": "S0112"
  },
  {
    "start": 182.0,
    "end": 183.36,
    "text": "你最終能重新獲利",
    "segment_id": "S0113"
  },
  {
    "start": 183.36,
    "end": 184.56,
    "text": "過去幾個例子",
    "segment_id": "S0114"
  },
  {
    "start": 184.56,
    "end": 186.04000000000002,
    "text": "之前很多人說幾百塊錢",
    "segment_id": "S0115"
  },
  {
    "start": 186.04000000000002,
    "end": 187.16,
    "text": "就是幫別人的實體店鋪",
    "segment_id": "S0116"
  },
  {
    "start": 187.16,
    "end": 188.4,
    "text": "放到地圖上去",
    "segment_id": "S0117"
  },
  {
    "start": 188.4,
    "end": 189.44,
    "text": "那其實這是免費的",
    "segment_id": "S0118"
  },
  {
    "start": 189.44,
    "end": 190.48000000000002,
    "text": "而且只需要在手機上",
    "segment_id": "S0119"
  },
  {
    "start": 190.48000000000002,
    "end": 191.64000000000001,
    "text": "跟兩下就行了",
    "segment_id": "S0120"
  },
  {
    "start": 191.64000000000001,
    "end": 192.60000000000002,
    "text": "還有說八百塊錢",
    "segment_id": "S0121"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.60000000000002,
    "end": 193.32,
    "text": "帶罷什麼",
    "segment_id": "S0122"
  },
  {
    "start": 193.32,
    "end": 194.24,
    "text": "音業執照",
    "segment_id": "S0123"
  },
  {
    "start": 194.24,
    "end": 195.32,
    "text": "也是同理",
    "segment_id": "S0124"
  },
  {
    "start": 195.32,
    "end": 196.0,
    "text": "最搞笑的是",
    "segment_id": "S0125"
  },
  {
    "start": 196.0,
    "end": 197.20000000000002,
    "text": "別人傍王如果想住銷了",
    "segment_id": "S0126"
  },
  {
    "start": 197.20000000000002,
    "end": 198.56,
    "text": "你還能雙向收費",
    "segment_id": "S0127"
  },
  {
    "start": 198.56,
    "end": 200.44,
    "text": "也有說他八百塊錢給他住銷",
    "segment_id": "S0128"
  },
  {
    "start": 200.44,
    "end": 201.52,
    "text": "我只能你可以解決一些",
    "segment_id": "S0129"
  },
  {
    "start": 201.52,
